746
00:37:31,276 --> 00:37:32,677
[SPEAKER_02]: So, I don't know.

747
00:37:34,078 --> 00:37:36,500
[SPEAKER_02]: I'll stick with the old Mother Earth play.

748
00:37:38,677 --> 00:37:44,061
